<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-top: 4px solid #15803d; text-align: center; }
      .icon { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: #f0fdf4; color: #166534; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
      h2 { color: #111; margin-top: 0; font-size: 22px; }
      p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; text-align: left; }
      .alert-box { font-size: 13px; color: #991b1b; background: #fef2f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #fee2e2; margin-top: 20px; text-align: left; }
      .footer { margin-top: 35px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="icon">✓</div>
      <h2>Password Reset Successful</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>Your security password credentials have been updated successfully.</p>
      <p>You can now securely log back into your CraftBridge System workspace dashboard using your newly generated password configuration parameters.</p>
      
      <p class="alert-box">⚠️ <strong>Critical Security Warning:</strong> If you did not authorize or execute this update modification yourself, your account security settings could be compromised. Please contact our system support administration team immediately to secure your credentials block.</p>
      
      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> CraftBridge System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
